# name url sha [language]  (release tags, pinned by commit so runs are reproducible)
# language is `ts` (the default, TypeScript and JavaScript) or `rust`; it picks the file globs, the declaration pattern
# and the test-path rule in rg-compare.py. fd is v10.5.2.
